---
source: crates/jailint/tests/rules.rs
---
warning[integer_division_in_float]: integer division `done / total` is converted to a float: the remainder is lost first
  --> tests/lint/integer_division_in_float/bad.jai:6:27
   |
 6 |     ratio := cast(float) (done / total);
   |                           ^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: divide as floats: `cast(float) done / total`
   |
 5       total := 4;
 6 ~     ratio := cast(float) (cast(float) done / total);
 7       width := 10.0;
   |
   = note: `integer_division_in_float` is `warn` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/integer_division_in_float

warning[integer_division_in_float]: integer division `1 / 2` is used in float arithmetic: the remainder is lost first
  --> tests/lint/integer_division_in_float/bad.jai:8:13
   |
 8 |     half := 1 / 2 * width;
   |             ^^^^^
   |
help: divide as floats: `1.0 / 2`
   |
 7       width := 10.0;
 8 ~     half := 1.0 / 2 * width;
 9
   |
   = note: `integer_division_in_float` is `warn` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/integer_division_in_float

warning[integer_division_in_float]: integer division `(done + total) / total` is used in float arithmetic: the remainder is lost first
  --> tests/lint/integer_division_in_float/bad.jai:10:13
   |
10 |     sum := (done + total) / total * 0.5;
   |             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: divide as floats: `cast(float) (done + total) / total`
   |
 9
10 ~     sum := cast(float) (done + total) / total * 0.5;
11
   |
   = note: `integer_division_in_float` is `warn` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/integer_division_in_float
